  <section id="sect-00001"><para dir="ltr" id="para-00001">Solve the system of equations using elimination.</para>
<para dir="ltr" id="para-00002">\(\left\{\begin{array}{l}\;6x\;–\;5y\;=\;–34\\2x\;+\;6y\;=\;4\end{array}\right.\)</para></section>
